-    <string name="ts_footer_body">1. Obtain a valid keybox XML from a trusted source.\n2. Tap \"Import keybox\" and load the file.\n3. Open \"Manage target apps\" and select the apps that require integrity checks.\n4. Set target mode to \"Leaf\" if your device has a working TEE; otherwise leave it as Auto.\n5. Recheck your Play Integrity status.\n\nRevocation status is checked every 24 hours when this screen is opened. Tap \"Check revocation status\" to check it manually. Always delete the existing keybox before importing a new one. If Google revokes a keybox, it may still allow passing up to device integrity even though strong integrity will fail.</string>
